  "solution": "Given equation: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58.\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**11 ÷ 77**__ - 253 × 23 + 800 = 58\n\n⇒ 0.14 - __**253 × 23**__ + 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**0.14**__ - 5819 __**+**____** 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**800.14 - 5819**__ = 58\n\n⇒ - 5018.86 ≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) × and ÷**\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 11 × 77 + __**253 ÷ 23**__ – 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**11 ×**____** 77**__ + 11 – 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**847 + 11**__ – 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**858**____** – 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ **58 = 58**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS.**\n\nOption 3) + and -\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**11 ÷ 77**__ - 253 × 23 + 800 = 58\n\n⇒ 0.14 - __**253 × 23**__ + 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**0.**____**14**__ - 5819 __**+ 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __800.14 - 5819__ = 500\n\n⇒ - 5018.86 ≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) - and ×\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the Symbols & Numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**11 ÷ 77**__ + 253 × 23 × 800 = 58\n\n⇒ 0.14 + __**253 **____**× 23 ×**____** 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**0.14 + 4655200**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 4655200.14 ≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
